{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃又南昨日（2日）迎來43歲生日，特意在個人社交平台發長文回顧過去一年的收穫與感悟。</p><p>面對人生的起伏，他坦言「事在人為」，不僅在影視事業交出亮眼成績單，更跨界解鎖多項驚喜成就，獲得不少粉絲祝福。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:27.762178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:47:48+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:04.810715+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:04.810715+00:00","content_hash":"c849cec9b04c18bcb0d6252d515477df36993c7b55a0861f8dfb4bf6322b3d9c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}